# KlubServ – Web-Based Sports Club Management Platform

Welcome to KlubServ! This project is a modern, full-stack platform for managing sports club memberships, payments, communication, and digital operations.

This README defines the **architecture**, **rules**, and **development principles** to be followed consistently throughout the project using Cursor.

---

## 📦 Tech Stack Summary

| Layer             | Technology                      |
|------------------|----------------------------------|
| Frontend         | Next.js (App Router) + Tailwind CSS |
| Backend API      | Node.js + Express                |
| Auth             | Clerk (JWT, SSO, Invite Links)   |
| Database         | PostgreSQL                       |
| ORM              | Prisma                           |
| Monorepo Tooling | Turborepo                        |
| UI Components    | Tailwind + Shared React UI (packages/ui) |
| Deployment       | Vercel (frontend), Render/Supabase (backend) |
| Language         | TypeScript                       |
| Testing          | Vitest / Playwright / Jest       |

---

